<template><section class="profiles"><h3>나에게 맞는 플레이어</h3><p>이 기기에 자동 저장돼요. 키 배치는 혼자·온라인·키보드 두 개에서 적용됩니다.<br>한 키보드 2P는 기존 분리 배치를 사용해요.</p><article v-for="(profile,i) in model" :key="i"><h4>{{ profile.avatar }} {{ i+1 }}P 프로필</h4><label>이름<input :aria-label="`${i+1}P 이름`" v-model="profile.name" maxlength="16"></label><label>아바타<select :aria-label="`${i+1}P 아바타`" v-model="profile.avatar"><option v-for="a in avatars" :key="a">{{ a }}</option></select></label><div class="profile-speed"><label>첫 반복 대기 {{ profile.delay }}ms<input :aria-label="`${i+1}P 첫 반복 대기`" type="range" min="100" max="400" step="10" v-model.number="profile.delay"></label><label>반복 간격 {{ profile.repeat }}ms<input :aria-label="`${i+1}P 반복 간격`" type="range" min="30" max="200" step="10" v-model.number="profile.repeat"></label></div><details><summary>키 배치 바꾸기</summary><div class="profile-keys"><label v-for="control in controls" :key="control">{{ controlNames[control] }}<select :aria-label="`${i+1}P ${controlNames[control]} 키`" :value="profile.keys[control]" @change="bind(i,control,($event.target as HTMLSelectElement).value)"><option v-for="key in keyOptions" :key="key" :value="key">{{ keyLabel(key) }}</option></select></label></div><small>이미 쓰는 키를 고르면 두 동작의 키를 서로 바꿔요.</small></details></article></section></template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import {avatars,controls,controlNames,keyOptions,keyLabel,type PlayerProfile,type Control} from '~/game/PlayerProfiles'
const model=defineModel<[PlayerProfile,PlayerProfile]>({required:true})
function bind(i:number,action:Control,key:string){const p=model.value[i]!;const old=p.keys[action],other=controls.find(c=>p.keys[c]===key);if(other)p.keys[other]=old;p.keys[action]=key}
</script>
<style scoped>.profiles p{line-height:1.8}.profiles article{border:1px solid #ffffff30;border-radius:16px;padding:15px;margin:12px 0;background:#ffffff08}.profiles h4{margin:0 0 12px}.profiles label{display:block;font-size:12px;margin:10px 0}.profiles input:not([type=range]),.profiles select{box-sizing:border-box;max-width:100%;width:100%;min-height:40px;padding:8px;border:1px solid #ffffff40;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;color:#244c6a}.profiles input[type=range]{width:100%}.profile-speed,.profile-keys{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}.profiles summary{cursor:pointer;padding:10px 0}.profiles small{font-size:10px;color:#aec4dd}</style>

<style scoped>.profiles .profile-keys label,.profiles .profile-speed label{margin:6px 0!important}.profiles .profile-keys select{margin-top:4px!important}.profiles h4{color:#28536d}.profiles article{border-color:#9dbdd3;background:#ffffff4d}.profiles .profile-keys{gap:7px 12px}.profiles label input:not([type=range]){margin-top:5px}</style>
